                    <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/portable-cabin-fabrication" class="text-warning">Fabrication</a></li>
                    <li class="breadcrumb-item active text-white" aria-current="page">Events Cabins</li>
                </ol>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro Section -->
    <section class="py-5 bg-white">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
                <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-right">
                    <span class="section-label">Temporary Event Infrastructure</span>
                    <h2 class="section-title">Event-Ready Cabins, Delivered Fast</h2>
                    <p class="lead text-muted mt-4">We serve event organizers with temporary offices, ticket cabins, guard posts and welfare units for events, exhibitions and venues across Qatar.</p>
                    <p class="text-muted">Our cabins are manufactured in-house at our Doha workshop by a team of 150+ specialists, and we have been manufacturing portable cabins in Qatar since 2009. Units are delivered fully assembled or flat-pack direct to your venue, and our specialised crew handles on-site installation. Guard cabins are typically ready in 5&ndash;10 working days.</p>
                    <div class="row mt-4">
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i> Guard Cabins in 5&ndash;10 Working Days</li>
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i> VIP Toilets Available</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                            <ul class="list-unstyled">
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i> Fully Relocatable Units</li>
                                <li class="mb-2"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill text-warning me-2"></i> T3 AC for 50&deg;C+ Heat</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-bc btn-bc-yellow mt-4">Request a Quote <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left">
                    <div class="position-relative text-center">
                        <img src="/Uploads/WhatsApp Image 2026-04-22 at 3.41.43 PM.jpeg" class="img-fluid shadow-lg" alt="Portable cabin for events in Qatar" style="border-radius: 20px;">
                        <div class="bg-primary-yellow position-absolute p-4 d-none d-md-block" style="bottom: -30px; right: -30px; border-radius: 15px; max-width: 250px;">
                            <h5 class="fw-bold mb-0 text-dark">Event Organizers Welcome</h5>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Applications -->
    <section class="py-5 bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <span class="section-label">What We Supply</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Event Cabins &amp; Facilities</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="bc-card h-100">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2">Temporary Offices</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Climate-controlled temporary offices for event management teams, with pre-installed electrical, data and T3 tropical-rated AC provisions for 50&deg;C+ heat.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <div class="bc-card h-100">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2">Ticket Cabins</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Compact ticket cabins and kiosks for venue entrances &mdash; high-visibility units with sliding windows and secure, lockable doors.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                    <div class="bc-card h-100">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2">Guard Posts</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Security guard cabins with 360-degree visibility for event gates and checkpoints. Fast-build turnaround &mdash; 5&ndash;10 working days.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="bc-card h-100">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2">Welfare Units</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Welfare units for event staff and crews, with EPS / Rockwool insulation and easy-clean, low-maintenance interiors.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
                    <div class="bc-card h-100">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2">Portable Toilets &amp; VIP Toilets</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Portable toilets that meet high hygiene standards &mdash; basic units, VIP toilets, and units with hand-washing stations, urinals or showers, perfect for events.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                    <div class="bc-card h-100">
                        <h4 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-2">Storage &amp; Back-of-House</h4>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Secure storage cabins and back-of-house units for equipment, merchandising and event operations.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

