                    <p class="small text-muted mt-3">Prices are indicative only. See the full <a href="/portable-cabin-price-in-qatar">portable cabin price guide</a> or use the <a href="/#price-calculator">Porta Cabin Price Calculator</a> for an instant estimate.</p>
                    <p class="text-muted">All cabins are fully customizable &mdash; layouts, finishes, dimensions, extra insulation, air conditioning, partitions, plumbing and electrical work can be tailored to your event.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="py-5 bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
                <span class="section-label">Good To Know</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-lg-9">
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>How quickly can you supply cabins for an event?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Guard cabins are typically ready in 5&ndash;10 working days. Standard portable office cabins can also be fabricated and delivered quickly &mdash; tell us your event date and we will confirm a fabrication and delivery schedule with your quote.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Do you offer portable toilets and VIP toilets for events?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we provide portable toilets that meet high hygiene standards. Options include basic units, VIP toilets, and those with hand-washing stations, urinals, or showers &mdash; perfect for job sites, events, and remote locations.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Can cabins be customized for an event?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Absolutely. We offer fully customizable layouts, finishes, features, and dimensions. Whether you need extra insulation, air conditioning, partitions, plumbing, or electrical work, our team can tailor your structure to meet your needs.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Do you deliver and install at event venues across Qatar?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. We deliver fully assembled or flat-pack units direct to your venue, and our specialised crew handles on-site installation &mdash; across Doha, Lusail, Al Wakrah, Al Rayyan, Mesaieed, Al Khor, Ras Laffan and beyond. See our <a href="/portable-cabin-fabrication">fabrication page</a> for the full process.</div>
                    </details>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="py-5" style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <div class="container text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
            <span class="section-label">Get Started</span>
            <h2 class="fw-bold text-uppercase mb-3" style="font-size:2.2rem;">Plan Your Event Infrastructure</h2>
            <p class="mb-4" style="color:#aaa;">Manufacturing portable cabins in Qatar since 2009. Call us or request a quote &mdash; tell us the event date, venue and the cabins you need and we will price your exact specification.</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
                <a href="tel:+97450307568" class="btn-bc btn-bc-yellow"><i class="bi bi-telephone-fill me-2"></i> +974 50307568</a>
                <a href="mailto:info@bestchoiceqatar.net" class="btn-bc btn-bc-outline-white">info@bestchoiceqatar.net</a>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn-bc btn-bc-yellow">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 mb-0 small" style="color:#888;">Also see: <a href="/product/security-guard-cabins" style="color:#ffcc00;">Security Guard Cabins</a> &middot; <a href="/product/portable-toilets" style="color:#ffcc00;">Portable Toilets</a> &middot; <a href="/product/portable-office-cabins" style="color:#ffcc00;">Portable Office Cabins</a> &middot; <a href="/portable-cabin-price-in-qatar" style="color:#ffcc00;">Portable Cabin Price Guide</a> &middot; <a href="/portable-cabin-fabrication" style="color:#ffcc00;">Portable Cabin Fabrication</a></p>
        </div>
    </section>


